  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Bring a dose of cuteness to your everyday look with the Cute Bear Phone Case. Featuring an adorable bear sketch design and a matching fluffy plush bear keychain, this case is the perfect blend of fun and function. Made with a durable, soft-touch material, it provides reliable protection while adding a playful charm to your phone. ✨ Features: • Cute bear sketch design with heart detail • Comes with a matching plush bear keychain • Soft-touch material with a comfortable grip • Shock-absorbent and scratch-resistant • Lightweight and protective without bulk • Compatible with multiple iPhone models Perfect for anyone who loves kawaii-style accessories, this phone case is as protective as it is adorable. 🐻✨",
